               PERFORM CHECK-MANAGED-FUND-0002.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-BEDROOMS-0003.
               PERFORM RECONCILE-BEDROOMS-0005.
               PERFORM FORMAT-MODEL-0006.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0007.
               PERFORM CHECK-MANAGED-FUND-0008.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-EXCESS-0009.
               PERFORM COMPUTE-TAX-BAND-0010.
               PERFORM DERIVE-STATUS-CODE-0011.
               PERFORM APPLY-TERM-0012.
               PERFORM FORMAT-STATUS-CODE-0013.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0014.
               PERFORM DERIVE-SUM-ASSURED-0015.
